Subject: [PATCH 02/27] server : switch to a better cached prompt instead of
 keeping a partially matching slot

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.1
---
 tools/server/server-context.cpp               |  34 ++++-
 tools/server/server-task.cpp                  |  36 ++++-
